  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth- Echoing Green- Kadiwaku Family Foundation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This grant represents the first contribution of USADF towards its MOU with Echoing Green signed in June 2018. The Kadiwaku Family Foundation (KFF) and its founder John Ntonta are winners of the prestigious 2018 Echoing Green Global Fellowship. Mr. Ntonta, himself disabled, is the CEO and Founder of KFF, an organization that seeks to work to include disabled Congolese into society through literacy and entrepreneurship programs. KFF wishes to expand its programming to all provinces of DRC in the coming years.</narrative>
  </description>
